---
title: Quote-to-Policy Sequence — successful conversion path
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 42
    messageFontSize: 12
    noteFontSize: 11
    boxMargin: 8
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    actor A as Associate
    participant QS as Quote Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    actor U as Underwriter
    participant PG as Payment Gateway

    rect rgb(232, 241, 251)
    Note over C,DB: A. CAPTURE — UC-01 to UC-05
    C->>A: Request a quote
    A->>QS: Look up customer, account, product line
    QS->>DB: SELECT CUSTOMER, ACCOUNT
    Note right of DB: uq_account_business blocks duplicates
    QS->>DB: INSERT QUOTE (Draft) + QUOTE_STATUS_HISTORY
    C->>A: Choose coverages, limits, deductibles
    QS->>DB: INSERT QUOTE_COVERAGE
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over QS,U: B. RATE — UC-06 to UC-09
    QS->>DB: UPDATE QUOTE -> Submitted
    QS->>DB: Read ACCOUNT_GEOGRAPHY, MV_ACCOUNT_REGIONAL_HEALTH_PROFILE
    Note right of DB: County-level aggregate only.<br/>ck_qrf_source rejects patient-level sources.
    QS->>DB: INSERT QUOTE_RISK_FACTOR (RegionalAggregate)
    QS->>U: Present risk factors
    U->>DB: UPDATE ReviewStatus -> Reviewed
    Note right of U: Regional context informs awareness,<br/>it is not a rating input.
    QS->>DB: UPDATE QUOTE -> Rated, EstimatedPremium
    end

    rect rgb(252, 235, 241)
    Note over C,PG: C. DECIDE — UC-10 to UC-12
    A->>C: Present quote
    QS->>DB: UPDATE QUOTE -> Presented
    C->>A: Accept
    QS->>DB: UPDATE QUOTE -> Accepted
    C->>PG: Submit payment details directly
    PG-->>QS: Authorization reference
    Note right of PG: Card data never reaches<br/>the application or database.
    QS->>DB: INSERT PAYMENT_AUTHORIZATION (reference only)
    end

    rect rgb(233, 247, 236)
    Note over QS,DB: D. ISSUE THE POLICY — UC-13, UC-14, UC-16
    QS->>DB: INSERT CONTRACT (Active) = the issued policy
    QS->>DB: INSERT QUOTE_CONVERSION
    Note right of DB: uq_quote_conversion_quote<br/>prevents a second policy.
    QS->>DB: UPDATE QUOTE -> Converted
    QS->>DB: INSERT CONTRACT_BENEFIT, CONTRACT_PREMIUM
    QS->>DB: INSERT DATA_ASSET (path + SHA-256)
    Note right of DB: Document binary stays in the<br/>document store, not in PostgreSQL.
    A-->>C: Deliver policy
    end
